//│ deforest > call f@result @ nest_consume@nest_consume -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call f@result @ nest_consume@nest_consume -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call f@result @ nest_consume@nest_consume -> UnsafeEta
