//│ deforest > >>> accumulator syms >>>
//│ deforest > <<< accumulator syms <<<
//│ deforest > >>> effect-analysis results >>>
//│ deforest > function alias_then_patmat#0 @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > function alias_then_patmat#0 @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call +@result @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> Pure
//│ deforest > call +@result @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> Pure
//│ deforest > call +@result @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> Pure
//│ deforest > call +@result @ alias_then_patmat@alias_then_patmat -> Pure
//│ deforest > call alias_then_patmat@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
